"DigUp reads the folders you choose and keeps what it learns in its index, on this Mac. It goes online only to download its model, once, and to check for updates (General), which sends nothing about your files." = "DigUp 读取你选择的文件夹，并将索引保存在这台 Mac 上。它只会联网下载一次模型并检查更新（“通用”），不会发送任何文件信息。";
"DigUp %@ · EmbeddingGemma 2 by Google (Apache 2.0), run by llama.cpp (MIT)." = "DigUp %@ · Google 的 EmbeddingGemma 2（Apache 2.0），由 llama.cpp（MIT）运行。";
"Find code by what it does, or by a name in it: type code: in the search panel, as in “code: retry with backoff”. Code has an index of its own, and it never shows up in other searches." = "按功能或其中的名称查找代码：在搜索面板中输入 code:，例如“code: 带退避的重试”。代码使用独立索引，不会出现在其他搜索中。";
"No code folders yet. Add the folders that hold your projects." = "尚无代码文件夹。请添加存放项目的文件夹。";
"Code folders" = "代码文件夹";
"A result opens there at the line that matched. Space shows the whole file in Quick Look." = "结果会在匹配行处用所选应用打开。按空格可在快速查看中显示整个文件。";
"The code index keeps your code's text on this Mac, as the main index keeps your documents'. It skips what git ignores, vendored and generated code, data files, and anything that looks like a key or a password." = "代码索引会像主索引保存文档内容一样，将代码文本保存在这台 Mac 上。它会跳过 git 忽略的内容、第三方与生成的代码、数据文件，以及看起来像密钥或密码的内容。";
